## Overview

Aegis (persistHunt) inspects Linux hosts for covert persistence mechanisms across initialization vectors, daemon definitions, and user environment hooks.

## Key Inspection Surfaces

- **Systemd**: Analyzes user and system unit directories (`/etc/systemd/system`, `~/.config/systemd/user`) for non-standard triggers and timers.
- **Cron**: Inspects `/etc/crontab`, `/etc/cron.*`, and spool tables for hidden scheduled executions.
- **Shell Startup**: Scans `.bashrc`, `.bash_profile`, `/etc/profile.d/`, and fish/zsh configurations for alias hijacking or command injections.

